WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.322 --> 00:00:03.470
发送HTTP请求成为队首 / Send an HTTP request as queue head

2
00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:06.604
让响应进入同一HTTP队列 / Queue a response in the same HTTP queue

3
00:00:06.604 --> 00:00:10.196
检查Upgrade实际建立连接而未排队 / Observe Upgrade connecting without joining this queue

4
00:00:10.196 --> 00:00:13.295
选择已经建立的WS连接 / Select the established WS connection

5
00:00:13.295 --> 00:00:16.693
发送第一条WS帧成为独立队首 / Send the first WS frame as its own queue head

6
00:00:16.693 --> 00:00:19.923
源站帧进入同一WS队列 / Queue an origin frame in the same WS queue

7
00:00:19.923 --> 00:00:23.929
为HTTP队首填写但不提交草稿 / Enter an HTTP head draft without submitting it

8
00:00:23.929 --> 00:00:27.156
选择排队响应，只读查看 / Select the queued response for read-only inspection

9
00:00:27.156 --> 00:00:30.953
选择已建立的连接，不伪造Queued / Select the established connection without claiming Queued

10
00:00:30.953 --> 00:00:34.339
回到HTTP队首并打开批量菜单 / Return to the HTTP head and open batch actions

11
00:00:34.339 --> 00:00:38.154
仅Continue HTTP队列，草稿不应用 / Continue only HTTP without applying the draft

12
00:00:38.154 --> 00:00:41.534
回到WS确认等待项仍在 / Return to WS and confirm its waits remain

13
00:00:41.534 --> 00:00:45.053
仅Drop当前WS队列 / Drop only the current WS queue

14
00:00:45.053 --> 00:00:48.126
为退出场景挂起新HTTP请求 / Hold a new HTTP request for the exit scenario

15
00:00:48.126 --> 00:00:51.398
同时保留一条WS等待项 / Retain a WS wait at the same time

16
00:00:51.398 --> 00:00:54.386
记录真实Close之前的两条等待 / Record both waits before the actual Close
